        <profile name="Fate Reader" typeId="a0e6-a7b4-d55d-85b8" typeName="Warlord Trait" hidden="false" id="8f9c-2bbf-d380-fbe1">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">If chosen as the army’s Warlord, Eldrad Ulthran automatically has Fate Reader as his Warlord Trait and may not select any other.


If an army’s Warlord has this Trait, then at the start of the battle before any models are deployed, up to three units with the Infantry or Cavalry Unit Type in your army may be given the Infiltrate and Scout Special Rule.


In addition, an army whose Warlord has this Trait may make an additional Reaction in any one Phase of the Controlling Player’s choice once per turn, as long as the Warlord has not been removed as a casualty.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Armour of the Last Runes" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="fd23-9970-5e5c-f014">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">The Armour of the Last Runes confers a 3+ Invulnerable Save.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Staff of Ulthamar" typeId="1a1a-e592-2849-a5c0" typeName="Weapon" hidden="false" id="bea8-c9ed-fdfa-d763">
          <characteristics>
